{
  "name": "model_unavailable",
  "class": "недоступность модели",
  "description": "Блокировка соединения stream-worker -> model-service: задание ok остаётся ожидающим (requests_pending >= 1, фиктивной вероятности нет), no_history завершается, события обрабатываются; после восстановления — ровно один правильный результат (§9).",
  "question": "Пока model-service остановлен, поданы r-u1 (ok) и r-u2 (no_history). Какое из заданий завершится и почему? Что вернёт GET /predictions/r-u1 до восстановления?",
  "input": {
    "observed_from": "2011-01-01",
    "observed_until": "2011-04-01",
    "reference_until": "2011-03-01"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "reset"
    },
    {
      "op": "activate",
      "model_name": "hw4-logistic",
      "model_version": "1",
      "activation_id": "scen-mu-1"
    },
    {
      "op": "time",
      "now": "2011-02-01",
      "closed_until": "2011-01-01"
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-u1",
        "invoice_id": "I990",
        "stock_code": "S1",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 1,
        "invoice_at": "2011-01-10T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "10.000000",
        "customer_id": "A",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "model_block"
    },
    {
      "op": "request",
      "payload": {
        "request_id": "r-u1",
        "client_id": "A",
        "as_of": "2011-02-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "request",
      "payload": {
        "request_id": "r-u2",
        "client_id": "D",
        "as_of": "2011-02-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_predictions",
      "request_ids": [
        "r-u2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_prediction",
      "request_id": "r-u2",
      "status": "no_history",
      "features": null,
      "model_name": null,
      "model_version": null,
      "probability": null
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_pending_prediction",
      "request_id": "r-u1"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "requests_pending",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "predictions_written",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "События обрабатываются во время блокировки: worker не останавливается. Границу ждём только по событиям: r-u1 не будет подтверждён, пока модель недоступна."
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-u2",
        "invoice_id": "I991",
        "stock_code": "S1",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 1,
        "invoice_at": "2011-01-11T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "5.000000",
        "customer_id": "A",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_events"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "attributed_new",
      "value": 2
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "events_pending",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "op": "model_unblock"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_prediction",
      "request_id": "r-u1",
      "status": "ok",
      "features": {
        "order_count_90d": 1,
        "total_amount_90d": "10.000000",
